<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Inventory amounts recognized into cost of goods
sold for the six months ended September 30, 2025 and 2024 were $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CostOfGoodsAndServicesSold" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-5718">440,097</ix:nonFraction>&#160;and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c7" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CostOfGoodsAndServicesSold" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-5719">484,569</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

