<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company recognized lease expenses for the
operating lease right-of-use assets office and warehouse over the lease period which is&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c1" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseRemainingLeaseTerm" id="ixv-5800">10</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;years.&#160;For the six months ended
September 30, 2025 and 2024, the operating lease expenses were $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-5801">34,776</ix:nonFraction>&#160;and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c7" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-5802">34,739</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<ix:continuation id="_LeaseCostTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Operating lease liabilities as of September 30, 2025 and March 31,
2025 consisted of the following:</p>

