</div><ix:continuation id="_LesseeOperatingLeasesTextBlock-c0_cont_1"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The discount rate used for the office and warehouse
was&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageDiscountRatePercent" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-5813">5.40</ix:nonFraction>%. The remaining lease term for the operating lease was&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c2" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1" id="ixv-5814">3.25</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;years.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

