</div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionsDisclosureTextBlock" id="ixv-5206"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>NOTE 16 &#8211; RELATED PARTY TRANSACTIONS</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

