<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;"> <tr style="vertical-align: bottom"> <td style="border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; width: 49%; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Name of related parties</b></span></td> <td style="width: 2%; text-align: justify">&#160;</td> <td style="border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; width: 49%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Relationship with the Company</b></span></td></tr> <tr style="vertical-align: bottom"> <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td> <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td></tr>
